# Line endings.
#
# Everything git stores is already LF. Without this file a Windows checkout
# converts it to CRLF in the working tree, which Prettier then reports as an
# error on every single line — `npx eslint` returns ~19k "Delete \r" findings
# and `npm run lint` (which runs --fix) rewrites the entire tree, burying real
# changes in an unreviewable diff. See docs/DEVELOPMENT.md.
#
# eol=lf keeps the working tree LF on every platform, so lint output stays
# readable and diffs stay honest.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Source documents — never line-ending converted, never diffed as text.
*.pdf binary
